    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "****UNDER OFFER****\r\n\r\nDillon Prendiville Auctioneers are delighted to present this 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom semi-detached home which offers a rare opportunity to secure a residence in the highly sought-after, mature estate of Lartigue Village, Clieveragh.  Presented in very good condition throughout, the property features a spacious, low-maintenance site secured by block-built boundary walls, gated vehicle access, and ample off-street parking for multiple cars.  There is plenty of scope to extend the property for a growing family.  The property benefits from all mains services, oil-fired central heating and double-glazed uPVC windows.  \r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned just a stone’s throw from Listowel town centre, you’ll enjoy unparalleled ease of access to local schools, sports clubs, gyms, and the scenic Town Park. Whether you're exploring the nearby Kerry-Limerick Greenway or enjoying the town's vibrant restaurants and shops, this home places the best of Listowel right at your doorstep. Properties in this quiet, established neighbourhood rarely stay on the market long - viewing is highly recommended to appreciate everything this gem has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.3m x 2.0m \r\nTiled floor, staircase to first floor with wc and whb under stairs.  \r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.7m x 4.0m \r\nLaminate flooring, solid fuel open fireplace, built in display cabinet and bay window.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 6.2m x 3.8m \r\nTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen with electric oven, hob and overhead extractor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, hotpress, sliding patio door to spacious rear garden. \r\n\r\nLanding - 3.1m x 2.1m \r\nVinyl flooring, gable window, attic hatch.  \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom (En-suite) - 3.7m x 3.9m \r\nVinyl flooring, recessed built in wardrobe, overlooking rear garden.\n\nTiled floor, Triton T90si electric shower, wc and whb.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.3m x 3.9m \r\nVinyl flooring, recessed built in wardrobe, street view. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.0m x 2.6m \r\nVinyl flooring, recessed built in wardrobe, street view. \r\n\r\nFamily bathroom - 2.3m x 1.8m \r\nTiled floor and part tiled walls, wc, whb, bath with overhead shower. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Built in 2002\r\nLarge site with gravel driveway front and back.\r\nConcrete set down area suitable as a base for a shed or patio area.  \r\n10 Minute walk to the town centre.  15 Minute drive to Ballybunion.  \r\nLocated at the rear of the estate.\r\nPVC Fascia Soffit\r\nContact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers to arrange a viewing - 068 21739."
      },
